OL,3,GNEWSATrio pulled from sea in 'quite
OL,4,Aintense' rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and two boys have been rescued
OL,7,Ffrom the sea at a beach on which two
OL,8,Fpeople die earlier this summer.
OL,10,FA major rescue operation was launched
OL,11,Fon Wednesday night at Fistral Beach in
OL,12,FNewquay after the group was washed into
OL,13,Fthe sea after getting stranded on rocks
OL,14,Fby the incoming tide.
OL,16,FTwo coastguard teams, two RNLI
OL,17,Flifeboats and the coastguard helicopter
OL,18,Fwere sent to the incident at about
OL,19,F19:05 BST and the casualties were
OL,20,Fpulled into one of the lifeboats with
OL,21,Fthe help of two surfers.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
